# 统一换行符：避免 Windows / macOS 混合开发产生大量“假冲突”
# 仓库内统一为 LF，检出到工作区时由 git 自动处理
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确声明二进制文件，禁止任何换行符转换（否则图片会被写坏）
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary

# 文本文件显式声明，方便 GitHub 按语言统计与 diff
*.py  text
*.md  text
*.txt text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text
